      ],
      "en": "The LORD spoke to Moses in the plains of Moab by the Jordan at Jericho, saying,",
      "ko": "여호와께서 여리고 맞은편 요단 가 모압 평지에서 모세에게 일러 가라사대",
      "source_text_hash": "7c162341e693fe282da007ee67ad33d70c95c7bb5091c3aca9ecdb269cef1bc5",
      "translation_text_hash": "61be18b4ab5862915b77a29e7656adf566f7bc2a2dac78a79b629562c96ff55a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와께서 여리고 맞은편 요단 가 모압 평지에서 모세에게 일러 가라사대"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "61be18b4ab5862915b77a29e7656adf566f7bc2a2dac78a79b629562c96ff55a"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:NUM:35:2",
      "sequence": 4848,
      "chapter_label": "NUM 35",
      "verse_label": "2",
      "locator": {
